Ontario Player-Prop EV Report

A research-only player-prop expected-value system for an Ontario bettor.

What it does

- Evaluates player-prop odds using American odds.
- Calculates decimal odds and implied probabilities.
- Removes the bookmaker margin using two-sided prices.
- Calculates expected value per C$1.
- Rejects stale, incomplete or unverified quotes.
- Requires at least 20 relevant observations.
- Requires a minimum 5-percentage-point edge over the no-vig market probability.
- Produces a daily Markdown report.
- Never places bets.

Important data limitation

This starter does not have a verified live Ontario sportsbook odds feed. It will not invent prices or assume that US sportsbook prices are available in Ontario.

Only use current quotes that you have independently checked at an Ontario-authorized sportsbook. Both over and under prices are required.

Requirements

Python 3.11 or newer. No paid software or third-party Python packages are required.

Run

Copy "data/quotes.example.json" to "data/quotes.json", enter verified quote information, and run:

python -m src.main

The report will appear in "reports/latest.md".

Safety rules

A missing or unverified price is not a betting opportunity. If no candidate passes all checks, the report will say NO QUALIFYING BETS and recommend C$0 exposure.
